---
// Index.astro - Growth Systems Engineering Portfolio
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Growth Systems Engineer | Portfolio</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-color: #0f172a;
        --card-bg: #1e293b;
        --border-color: #334155;
        --primary-text: #f8fafc;
        --secondary-text: #94a3b8;
        --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
        --accent-green: #22c55e;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
        color: var(--primary-text);
        margin: 0;
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--accent-blue);
      }

      .hero-desc {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--secondary-text);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .status-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid var(--accent-green);
        color: var(--accent-green);
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--primary-text);
      }

      .system-grid {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .system-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      }

      .system-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .card-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .card-header h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--accent-blue);
      }

      .tier-tag {
        background: #0284c7;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .feature-box {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
        border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
      }

      .feature-box p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--secondary-text);
      }

      .tech-stack {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--secondary-text);
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      .cta-section {
        margin-top: 4rem;
        text-align: center;
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding: 2rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--accent-blue);
        color: #0f172a;
        font-weight: bold;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- HEADER / INTRO -->
      <header>
        <span class="status-badge">🟢 Available for Systems Setup</span>
        <h1>Growth Systems & Workflow Engineer</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          I build automated digital infrastructure that helps businesses capture leads instantly, eliminate repetitive admin work, and scale client operations without extra staff.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- MAIN PORTFOLIO SYSTEMS -->
      <main>
        <h2 class="section-title">Featured Systems & Automations</h2>
        
        <div class="system-grid">
          
          <!-- SYSTEM 1 -->
          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h3>1. Instant Lead Capture & CRM Pipeline</h3>
              <span class="tier-tag">Inbound Growth</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Problem Solved:</strong> Businesses losing inquiries because of slow manual reply times or missing lead tracking sheets.</p>
            <div class="feature-box">
              <p><strong>System Action:</strong> Captures form submissions instantly, cleans and logs contact details into an Airtable database, alerts the sales team on Telegram/Email, and sends an automated confirmation to the lead in under 60 seconds.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-stack"><strong>Tools Used:</strong> Tally Forms • Airtable CRM • Make.com • Gmail</div>
          </div>

          <!-- SYSTEM 2 -->
          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h3>2. Client Onboarding & Directory Generator</h3>
              <span class="tier-tag">Operations</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Problem Solved:</strong> Agency owners spending 30–45 minutes setting up folders, permissions, and contracts for every new client.</p>
            <div class="feature-box">
              <p><strong>System Action:</strong> Triggers automatically upon contract signing to generate standard Google Drive directory trees, copies document templates, and emails structured onboarding packets to the client.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-stack"><strong>Tools Used:</strong> Tally • Google Drive API • Make.com</div>
          </div>

          <!-- SYSTEM 3 -->
          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h3>3. Executive KPI & Daily Metrics Reporter</h3>
              <span class="tier-tag">Business Intelligence</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Problem Solved:</strong> Founders wasting hours compiling sales figures and operational data across different spreadsheets every morning.</p>
            <div class="feature-box">
              <p><strong>System Action:</strong> Runs automatically every morning to pull daily performance numbers, aggregate metrics, and email a clean, executive summary directly to key stakeholders.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-stack"><strong>Tools Used:</strong> Google Sheets • Array Aggregator • Gmail</div>
          </div>

          <!-- SYSTEM 4 -->
          <div class="system-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h3>4. Outbound Lead Enrichment Pipeline</h3>
              <span class="tier-tag">Outreach Automation</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Problem Solved:</strong> Sales teams manually searching and verifying prospect contact info line by line.</p>
            <div class="feature-box">
              <p><strong>System Action:</strong> Takes raw prospect databases, enriches contact details via custom API webhooks, and formats verified leads directly into outbound sales queues.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-stack"><strong>Tools Used:</strong> Airtable • Custom Webhooks • HTTP API Modules</div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </main>

      <!-- CALL TO ACTION -->
      <section class="cta-section">
        <h2>Want to Automate Your Business Systems?</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--secondary-text);">Get a free 5-minute system audit showing where your lead flow or operations are losing time.</p>
        <!-- Replace href link below with your Tally form link -->
        <a href="https://tally.so/forms/o96v1eo" target="_blank" class="btn">Request a Free Audit</a>
      </section>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>